WEBVTT

01:04.060 --> 01:12.110
<b><i>Destiny - Connections</i></b>

01:21.290 --> 01:25.290
<i>He's the one causing all this?</i>

01:31.090 --> 01:32.590
<i>Professor X...</i>

01:43.770 --> 01:44.980
<i>The world...</i>

01:45.890 --> 01:47.480
<i>is on the brink of destruction.</i>

01:50.060 --> 01:51.520
<i>To all mutants...</i>

01:52.320 --> 01:55.650
<i>this is Professor X,
of the X-Men.</i>

01:58.360 --> 02:03.620
<i>The phenomenon you are encountering</i>
<i>is occurring across the globe.</i>

02:10.040 --> 02:13.300
<i>The world needs you.</i>

02:14.840 --> 02:18.720
<i>The powerless,
and the uncanny...</i>

02:19.140 --> 02:22.640
<i>the time has come
for you to join hands.</i>

02:25.270 --> 02:30.190
<i>Right now there is no prejudice
or discrimination in the world...</i>

02:32.900 --> 02:34.900
<i>We are all united.</i>

02:49.750 --> 02:50.580
Charles!

02:52.130 --> 02:53.000
That boy...

02:54.090 --> 02:55.300
Takeo...

02:56.260 --> 02:58.090
He's your child!

03:07.310 --> 03:11.810
I thought my son was
no longer in this world.

03:32.960 --> 03:36.090
A father shouldn't fight his son!

03:36.750 --> 03:38.800
That's absolutely wrong!

03:40.260 --> 03:41.800
Dr. Sasaki!

03:46.760 --> 03:47.430
Takeo!

03:47.930 --> 03:48.810
Stop this!

03:49.310 --> 03:52.310
No one wants to
hurt you anymore!

03:55.440 --> 03:56.190
Doctor!

04:03.200 --> 04:05.200
You flamin' idiot!

04:14.500 --> 04:15.210
Wolverine!

04:24.720 --> 04:25.470
That can't be...

04:26.180 --> 04:27.220
lightning...

04:27.640 --> 04:29.430
electricity can't freeze!

04:45.410 --> 04:46.410
Stop it, Emma!

04:46.910 --> 04:48.990
Your mind will be destroyed!

05:01.170 --> 05:02.050
Impossible!

05:02.420 --> 05:06.680
My optic blasts shouldn't
affect me like this!

05:07.510 --> 05:11.020
It must be Takeo's power...

05:11.850 --> 05:13.480
the power to warp reality.

05:17.020 --> 05:18.610
Takeo, stop!

05:18.610 --> 05:20.690
You have to stop!

05:31.540 --> 05:33.660
Takeo, please stop!

05:34.540 --> 05:35.540
Takeo.

05:36.170 --> 05:37.670
Takeo.

05:42.670 --> 05:43.710
Takeo...

05:44.670 --> 05:46.430
you're a kind person.

05:48.680 --> 05:49.970
Hisako...

05:52.060 --> 05:52.970
Enough!

06:00.150 --> 06:01.270
Wait!

06:01.270 --> 06:02.070
Charles!

06:03.360 --> 06:06.700
I have no choice.

06:30.850 --> 06:33.850
Takeo kept the Professor
from entering his mind!

06:34.810 --> 06:39.440
Takeo's mind isn't bound
by reality anymore...

06:39.440 --> 06:41.110
it's beyond powerful!

07:00.750 --> 07:02.040
He made it in.

07:23.730 --> 07:24.650
Takeo.

07:35.580 --> 07:36.120
Now's our chance!

07:36.580 --> 07:40.500
While the Professor is inside,
we have to attack his body!

07:43.290 --> 07:45.590
Cycbps, don't!

07:45.590 --> 07:46.210
Hisako!?

07:47.090 --> 07:49.050
Takeo's defenseless!

07:49.050 --> 07:50.970
We can't attack him!

07:51.550 --> 07:53.260
And if Takeo dies...

07:53.260 --> 07:56.560
Charles consciousness
will also be destroyed.

07:57.060 --> 08:01.310
If Takeo's powers run wild again,
it'll mean the end of the world!

08:03.650 --> 08:04.770
But...

08:05.230 --> 08:06.690
but...

08:06.690 --> 08:07.270
Hisako!

08:08.150 --> 08:10.650
I want to empathize with
your feelings for your friend.

08:11.030 --> 08:15.870
But for once,
I gotta agree with Cyclops!

08:17.240 --> 08:18.700
We have to do it...

08:19.450 --> 08:20.540
to protect the world.

08:21.500 --> 08:23.460
Is that really true?

08:23.460 --> 08:26.170
Is that the only way
to save the world?

08:26.590 --> 08:29.630
If Takeo dies, will that really
solve everything?

08:30.260 --> 08:31.130
Hisako.

08:32.510 --> 08:37.100
This is a painful decision
for Cyclops as well.

08:46.440 --> 08:47.360
Takeo.

08:47.900 --> 08:50.150
Control your power.

08:50.150 --> 08:56.870
Your immense power is causing the
world, and yourself, suffering.

08:57.620 --> 09:00.830
I'll show you the way.

09:01.620 --> 09:02.370
Come.

09:17.220 --> 09:21.310
Do you hate me that much?

09:21.310 --> 09:24.640
You're rejecting me
because I'm your father!?

09:28.230 --> 09:29.320
This ain't good!

10:01.930 --> 10:03.720
You would ask me to give up?

10:04.560 --> 10:07.560
If I lose here, the world will end.

10:09.440 --> 10:15.150
I won't let my son
destroy the world!

10:22.910 --> 10:25.500
<i>Rise, X-Men...</i>

10:30.420 --> 10:31.170
<i>Jean.</i>

10:33.840 --> 10:38.590
<i>Guess I get a tearful reunion
with Jeanie in the afterlife...</i>

10:40.970 --> 10:42.680
<i>You can't give up.</i>

10:43.760 --> 10:46.140
<i>For the sake of mutantkind,
and humanity...</i>

10:47.060 --> 10:49.310
<i>you must not give up.</i>

10:51.360 --> 10:51.940
<i>That's right.</i>

10:52.940 --> 10:55.990
<i>Right now,
mutants and humans</i>

10:55.990 --> 10:58.400
<i>are rising up against
this threat together.</i>

11:21.010 --> 11:21.930
Was that...

11:22.390 --> 11:23.470
a hallucination?

11:24.560 --> 11:25.390
No...

11:25.810 --> 11:27.020
it was Jean.

11:28.480 --> 11:29.310
That's right.

11:30.560 --> 11:35.770
We cannot let ourselves
be brought down.

11:37.280 --> 11:41.530
We can't afford to let Takeo
continue to use his powers.

11:43.320 --> 11:49.580
<i>Jean, I think I understand
why you sacrificed yourself now...</i>

11:50.500 --> 11:53.290
<i>It was to protect your friends
and the world.</i>

11:58.260 --> 11:58.960
Emma?

11:59.670 --> 12:03.430
You intend on diving into Takeo and
unleash an optic blast, don't you?

12:04.720 --> 12:08.720
But if you do that,
you won't survive either.

12:10.480 --> 12:11.060
Emma.

12:11.520 --> 12:12.980
Let me go.

12:12.980 --> 12:13.560
No.

12:14.100 --> 12:14.900
What did you say?

12:15.770 --> 12:20.860
Didn't Jean entrust you with the futures
of mutantkind and humanity?

12:24.370 --> 12:27.660
No matter how hard it is,
you brace yourself,

12:27.660 --> 12:29.450
survive, and work through it...

12:29.950 --> 12:32.000
isn't that what Jean wanted?

12:38.000 --> 12:42.510
Takeo, can I not bear it?

12:45.220 --> 12:47.640
Takeo, will you not
let me accept your...

12:48.430 --> 12:50.100
Hatred and pain?

12:50.930 --> 12:51.930
Takeo...

12:56.110 --> 13:00.030
I have no choice but to
shut down Takeo's mind.

13:14.540 --> 13:20.210
Charles is trying to shut down
Takeo's mind to put a stop to this!

13:20.800 --> 13:21.880
No way!

13:22.550 --> 13:28.300
He intends to die inside of
Takeo's mind as it's shut off!

13:28.300 --> 13:29.430
What!?

13:29.430 --> 13:30.310
Charles!

13:31.560 --> 13:34.270
What kinda crap
is he trying to pull!?

13:34.270 --> 13:35.560
Dr. Sasaki!

13:38.900 --> 13:39.900
Takeo!

13:40.520 --> 13:42.480
If you want to take
someone with you, take me!

13:43.400 --> 13:45.530
Take your mother with you!

13:50.910 --> 13:53.250
I won't let you die alone.

13:54.200 --> 13:57.290
I'll endure your suffering with you.

13:57.790 --> 13:58.630
No!

14:00.460 --> 14:01.550
This...

14:01.960 --> 14:04.130
this can't be right!

14:05.800 --> 14:06.550
Hisako.

14:07.760 --> 14:09.350
I won't let it end...

14:10.100 --> 14:11.260
not like this!

14:29.990 --> 14:32.530
Takeo, it's Hisako.

14:33.620 --> 14:36.460
Do you remember how
I got this burn?

14:38.710 --> 14:39.580
Yeah...

14:39.880 --> 14:41.670
it's a painful memory, isn't it?

14:42.630 --> 14:43.340
But...

14:44.460 --> 14:46.880
we had good memories too,
didn't we?

14:47.550 --> 14:48.550
Lots of them...

14:49.340 --> 14:50.090
Lots of them...

14:52.100 --> 14:52.970
lots!

14:59.850 --> 15:00.560
Emma!

15:06.030 --> 15:07.070
Takeo...

15:07.650 --> 15:08.820
just stop.

15:09.320 --> 15:10.700
You don't have to suffer like this.

15:11.820 --> 15:12.870
Please...

15:13.330 --> 15:14.950
don't suffer anymore.

15:21.420 --> 15:22.250
Takeo.

15:28.670 --> 15:30.720
The armor's shape changed...

15:31.680 --> 15:34.300
It's shining so softly...

16:05.630 --> 16:09.090
You wanted to see me?

16:10.470 --> 16:13.680
You wanted my help?

16:15.010 --> 16:15.850
And...

16:16.680 --> 16:19.270
I never realized that or
understand you at all...

16:31.490 --> 16:33.820
Father...

16:41.960 --> 16:42.870
Takeo.

16:43.710 --> 16:44.920
I'm so sorry.

17:01.270 --> 17:02.180
Takeo.

17:05.560 --> 17:07.060
Mother...

17:16.950 --> 17:20.040
I knew this would happen some day.

17:21.830 --> 17:24.000
Even if it was to help Takeo,

17:24.000 --> 17:27.750
I sided with the U-Men
in their mutant hunts.

17:28.420 --> 17:30.800
I hurt a lot of people.

17:33.260 --> 17:36.720
I don't think my life will be enough
to pay for what I've done, but...

17:38.760 --> 17:40.850
I'm sorry, Charles.

17:42.470 --> 17:44.310
No!

17:54.950 --> 17:56.030
Takeo.

18:05.210 --> 18:06.540
<i>Thank you.</i>

18:09.540 --> 18:10.460
Yui...

18:11.130 --> 18:13.920
this is what Takeo wanted.

18:14.920 --> 18:20.010
No matter how hard it is,
for us to live on, hand-in-hand.

18:20.800 --> 18:23.720
That's what he wished for.

18:42.740 --> 18:45.830
Goodbye, Takeo.

18:49.790 --> 18:53.130
He didn't show any signs
of mutation at birth.

18:54.380 --> 18:58.680
It wasn't until he was older,
and was with Hisako, that it all began.

19:00.090 --> 19:04.970
It was when you visited, eight years ago,
that his powers manifested.

19:07.390 --> 19:09.770
Just being born my son

19:10.900 --> 19:13.360
gave him great power.

19:13.360 --> 19:17.280
And moreover,
for myself to awaken it...

19:19.530 --> 19:21.990
Even though I have
raised so many

19:21.990 --> 19:24.870
mutant children as my own,

19:25.870 --> 19:29.500
I killed my own son
with my own hands.

19:30.290 --> 19:31.040
But...

19:31.920 --> 19:34.210
he smiled in the end.

19:35.630 --> 19:39.130
I owe you thanks, Hisako.

19:46.310 --> 19:47.430
I...

19:49.390 --> 19:54.770
No matter how harsh reality is,
we have to face it.

19:56.480 --> 20:01.070
So that we can be a bridge
between mutants and humans.

20:03.030 --> 20:05.620
Even though there are people
like Mastermind

20:05.620 --> 20:08.790
and the incarcerated Magneto...

20:10.500 --> 20:12.710
The only thing Magneto can do

20:12.710 --> 20:16.170
is stare at the chessboard
in his cell.

20:16.670 --> 20:21.130
Love and friendship can defeat
the powers of evil.

20:22.430 --> 20:25.430
You proved that to me.

20:25.930 --> 20:27.850
Cyclops...

20:30.480 --> 20:31.730
I want you to have this.

20:35.980 --> 20:36.940
This is...

20:37.480 --> 20:39.440
We are friends who
can trust each other.

20:41.740 --> 20:43.030
It's proof of that.

20:45.780 --> 20:48.580
Thank you, Scott!

20:50.330 --> 20:51.330
Hey!

20:51.330 --> 20:55.670
But you know,
I learned a lot from Emma.

20:55.670 --> 20:58.090
Maybe you should take lessons
from Emma, too?

21:02.470 --> 21:06.970
Sounds like you have
a lot to learn, Scott.

21:09.640 --> 21:14.560
Hate to interrupt,
but our ride's fried to a crisp.

21:15.560 --> 21:16.980
Now what?

21:16.980 --> 21:18.230
Oh, dear...
